---
title: Proposed architecture — deterministic control around every model call
---
flowchart TB
  accTitle: Deterministic control with bounded stochastic work
  accDescr: Code routes classical work to classical handlers and admits declared judgment work through native adapters and an enforced model-call boundary. Models return proposals.
  H["HelpDesk journal — EXISTS<br/>Addressed correspondence and replay"]
  R["Deterministic runner — REQUIRED<br/>Schema, identity, grants, pins, limits"]
  D["Classical handler<br/>Zero model calls"]
  A["Harness adapter<br/>Fleet contract to native primitives"]
  C["Per-call enforcement — REQUIRED<br/>Protected credentials and egress control"]
  M["LLM<br/>Bounded proposal only"]
  V["Code validation and independent evidence<br/>Human judges unresolved semantics"]
  E["Authorized effect or receipt<br/>FleetRunner / resource owner"]
  H --> R
  R -->|"classical work"| D
  R -->|"declared judgment step"| A
  A --> C
  C --> M
  M --> V
  D --> V
  V --> E
